## 6. Open Questions for Later Phases

- Grid cell size: should it be fixed or configurable per crop type/sprayer width?
- Do we re-run zoning on every scan pass, or maintain a rolling/decaying
  severity score across multiple scans (to avoid false spray triggers from a
  single noisy pass)?
- Chemical dosing percentages need agronomist input — current numbers above
  are placeholders for the concept stage only.
- How `needs_review` points get resolved (human-in-the-loop UI vs. auto
  re-scan) — likely a dashboard feature (#34), not this issue.

